  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission, SSC</a> </span>has released the PE &amp; MT Admit Card for the post of Head Constable Ministerial on the official website of SSC. This recruitment was released for 456 posts. Applications for the Delhi Police Head Constable Ministerial Recruitment 2025 were accepted from September 29, 2025, to October 20, 2025. The CBT examination was held on 07-12 January 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their SSC Delhi Police Constable Ministerial PE &amp; MT Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Delhi Police Head Constable Ministerial PE &amp; MT Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>29 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>20 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>21 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"fon