\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 456</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 39.4611%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Male</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Female</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 39.4611%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Head Constable ((Ministerial))</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">168</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">82</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">34</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">17</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">77</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">38</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">49</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">24</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">13</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>341</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>168</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Head Constable Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Passed Class 12th (Intermediate) Exam With Science &amp; Mathematics as subjects form any recognized board will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Typing (English : 30 wpm / Hindi : 25 wpm)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Head Constable Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : Physical Measurement Test</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Measurement</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Male</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Female</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Height</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">165 CM (Relaxation as per rules)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">157 CM (Relaxation as per rules)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chest</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">78-82 CM (Relaxation as per rules)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">NA</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Head Constable Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility (Male)</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Race 1600 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">07 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3.6 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30-40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;